error[NK1335]: `fn(s: ref String) -> ref String` writes `from t`, but `t` is no parameter of `fn(s: ref String) -> ref String`.
  --> tests/views_fn_type_from_unknown_is_refused.nika:4:1
   |
 4 | fn apply(f: fn(s: ref String) -> ref String from t, s: String) -> String {
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: A result's `from` names the parameters its views point into (ADR-views-3 D8).
   = note: A function type names the parameters its `from` reads; the names do not change the type (ADR-views-3 D14).
   = help: Name one of `fn(s: ref String) -> ref String`'s parameters after `from`.
